mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Need[Concurrent writers or retries?] --> Q1{Same row Qty lost-update risk?}
  Q1 -->|Yes| Lock[SOQL FOR UPDATE then DML in one short transaction]
  Q1 -->|No| Q2{Duplicate insert if event or API retries?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| Idem[Upsert External ID or unique business key]
  Q2 -->|Partial DML wanted| Partial[Database methods allOrNone false]
  Lock --> Q3{Need a callout in this transaction?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| Split[Do not hold FOR UPDATE across the callout]
  Q3 -->|No| Hold[Keep lock until commit]
